Design a segment decoder that translates a 10-bit input into an 11-bit output based on specific patterns. The output will take on specified values ranging from 2000 to 800 based on the most significant bits of the input. If the input does not match any predefined case, the module will signal that the output is invalid by setting the valid flag to LOW and resetting the output to zero.
