description:
Design a 4-to-1 multiplexer that selects one of the four input data lines (D[0] to D[3]) based on the two-bit select signal (S). The output (Y) reflects the value of the selected input, where S=00 chooses D[0], S=01 selects D[1], S=10 chooses D[2], and S=11 selects D[3]. The circuit utilizes buffers for input lines D[0] to D[2] to ensure signal integrity before routing them to the output based on the select lines.
module top_module(
    input [3:0] D,
    input [1:0] S,
    output Y
);

