description:
Design a circuit that implements a two-input NAND gate with an inverted input. The module takes a non-inverted signal A_N and an inverted signal B, processes them through two NOT gates to invert their values, and then feeds the results into an AND gate. The final output, Y, is the result of this AND operation, which is logically equivalent to the NAND operation applied to the original inputs A_N and B.
module top_module(
    Y,
    A_N,
    B
);

