description:
Design a control signal generator for a system processing unit. This module takes an input enable signal (PERun_wen) and various other control signals to produce three output control signals: act_out_Push_mioi_biwt and act_out_Push_mioi_bdwt, which are gated by multiple conditions including the PERun_wen and the state of other inputs, and act_out_Push_mioi_ccs_ccore_start_rsc_dat_PERun_sct, which is driven by the input oswt_pff concurrently with PERun_wen. This module is intended for use in a system requiring precise control of operations based on the state of several input signals, facilitating synchronized processing in a broader functional architecture.
module top_module(
  PERun_wen, act_out_Push_mioi_oswt, act_out_Push_mioi_biwt, act_out_Push_mioi_bdwt,
      act_out_Push_mioi_bcwt, act_out_Push_mioi_ccs_ccore_start_rsc_dat_PERun_sct,
      act_out_Push_mioi_ccs_ccore_done_sync_vld, act_out_Push_mioi_oswt_pff
);

